=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Yorcia Weald} for a cutscene
** You may use a waypoint or the {p:Home Point} to {z:Yorcia Weald} to trigger this cutscene.

=4 Alternate Route
* This route should not be done your first time experiencing Ulbuka! Learn {p:Survival Skills} instead.
** It's also possible to get here initially by a back route requiring minimal survival skills so long as {s:Escape} can be used, often by subbing /BLM. By entering {z:Woh Gates} from {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} southwest of WP #4, you can then {s:Escape} and wind up at the end of {z:Yorcia Weald} close to WP #3 there. This all can be done solo without either {k:"Watercrafting"} or {k:"Climbing"}, just {k:Demolishing} is required for 1 colonization reive in {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} if there is no one around to clear it for you.

